# Where the registration form POSTs its JSON payload.
# Any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST works — Formspree, Getform,
# a Google Apps Script web app, or your own API route.
#
# Leave unset and the form renders in a "registration not open yet" state
# instead of silently discarding submissions.
NEXT_PUBLIC_REGISTRATION_ENDPOINT=

# Optional. Without it the venue map uses Google's keyless embed, which
# needs no setup. With it, the map switches to the official Maps Embed API
# (the supported, documented endpoint) — worth setting before launch.
# https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/embed/get-api-key
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
